    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/bgxyaavijhnezockwpcddtrtxlbhrghxgssijthquvzzljgqlc.jpeg\" /><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />In this case, the common chord is the same as the chord of contact <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>So, the equation of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> which is identical with <math><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
